{"id":"0d864764001d0fbd","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-separation-axioms.md","title":"Theorem — Hausdorff、sober 与 T0 的关系","display":"Theorem — Hausdorff、sober 与 T0 的关系","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-separation-axioms","aliases":["14-thm-separation-axioms"],"display":"Theorem — Hausdorff、sober 与 T0 的关系","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-space-category]]","[[14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality]]"],"source_location":"IX.2 Theorem 3 and proof, printed 475; DjVu 243","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-separation-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-separation-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Hausdorff、sober 与 T0 的关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4f43915f20a1466\" href=\"?note=c4f43915f20a1466\" title=\"14-df-topological-space-category\">14-df-topological-space-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bbaad5d88c97ae5\" href=\"?note=8bbaad5d88c97ae5\" title=\"14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality\">14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"IX.2 Theorem 3 and proof, printed 475; DjVu 243"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=(X,\\tau)\">\\(T=(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为小拓扑空间。闭包、不可约闭集与三个分离性质均使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bbaad5d88c97ae5\" href=\"?note=8bbaad5d88c97ae5\" title=\"14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality\">14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality</a> 的形式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall x\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{Irred}(\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{x\\}),T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{T}_0(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\ (\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{x\\})=\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{y\\})\\Rightarrow x=y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hausdorff}(T)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sober}(T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sober}(T)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{T}_0(T).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall x\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{Irred}(\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{x\\}),T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{T}_0(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\ (\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{x\\})=\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{y\\})\\Rightarrow x=y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hausdorff}(T)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sober}(T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sober}(T)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{T}_0(T).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}\\{x\\}\\subseteq C\\cup D\">\\(\\operatorname{cl}\\{x\\}\\subseteq C\\cup D\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\">\\(C,D\\)</span> 闭，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 属于其中一个，闭包也属于该闭集，给不可约性。点的所有开邻域相同当且仅当其闭包相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\">\\(T_0\\)</span> 等价于闭包映射单射，sober 的泛点唯一性立即给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\">\\(T_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>Hausdorff 空间中点为闭集。若非空不可约闭集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 含两个不同点，取其不交开邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span>，便有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(F\\setminus U)\\cup(F\\setminus V)\">\\(F=(F\\setminus U)\\cup(F\\setminus V)\\)</span>，右侧为两个真闭子集，矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为单点，且点唯一。空空间满足结论，不能从非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的证明误加全空间非空前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-space-category","status":"resolved","id":"c4f43915f20a1466","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-space-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality","status":"resolved","id":"8bbaad5d88c97ae5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality","status":"resolved","id":"8bbaad5d88c97ae5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T=(X,\\tau)$ 为小拓扑空间。闭包、不可约闭集与三个分离性质均使用 [[14-df-sobriety-and-spatiality]] 的形式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T=(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall x\\in X\\quad\\operatorname{Irred}(\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{x\\}),T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{T}_0(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\ (\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{x\\})=\\operatorname{cl}_T(\\{y\\})\\Rightarrow x=y),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Hausdorff}(T)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sober}(T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sober}(T)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{T}_0(T).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cl}\\{x\\}\\subseteq C\\cup D","display":false},{"tex":"C,D","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"T_0","display":false},{"tex":"T_0","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"F=(F\\setminus U)\\cup(F\\setminus V)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":1715,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separation-axioms|Theorem — Hausdorff、sober 与 T0 的关系]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separation-axioms]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separation-axioms]]"},{"id":"6bb5b9d57a0fd21c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separation-axioms]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-213","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separation-axioms]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separation-axioms|Theorem — Hausdorff、sober 与 T0 的关系]]"}],"outgoing":["c4f43915f20a1466","8bbaad5d88c97ae5"]}